WEBVTT

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:21.450
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:32.200
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:39.910
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:47.080
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.150
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:01.380
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:08.830
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:15.440
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:36.710
My opponent is Leon, the winner of the KC Grand Prix.

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:39.840
I'm sure we'll have a great duel.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:47.790
Leon used to have fun dueling, but he now looks sad in order to fulfill his mission.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.850
What happened to him?

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:54.540
What?  You’re Sieg's brother?

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:01.330
Golden Castle of Stromberg

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:09.220
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.470
Iron Cage!

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:15.160
It sends one monster on the field to the graveyard!

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:16.310
What?

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:24.030
Iron Cage will imprison Iron Hans!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.760
What?  His own monster?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:37.290
When Iron Hans leaves the field, Iron Knight’s repressed power is unleashed!

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.780
Its attack points increased!

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:43.310
I see!  This was his goal!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:47.900
Iron Knight attacks Obnoxious Celtic Guard!

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:07.790
Then Forest Hunter attacks you directly!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:18.210
This is bad.  He lost life points quickly.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.490
I end my turn.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:23.490
I see why he was able to defeat Rebecca.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.400
That child is a true duelist.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:31.400
Not only because he has talent and character.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:36.130
Since he loves his cards, his cards respond to him.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.400
That’s true.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.580
When Leon talked about dueling, he was happy.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:46.780
He cares about his cards just as much as Yugi does.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:50.680
I wish he could enjoy this duel.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.000
Not bad, Leon.  Impressive.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.860
I'm happy to get a compliment from you, Yugi.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:07.260
It was my dream to duel you with this deck.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:12.200
Since I was little, picture books were my only friend.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:16.640
Even if I was alone, I wasn't sad as long as I had my picture books.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:31.280
When I fell in love with Duel Monsters, I wrote a letter to Pegasus.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:35.350
Asking him to turn fairy tales into cards.

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:39.310
And now I have them.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.240
Leon...

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:46.130
I'll give it my all to defeat you!

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:50.000
With these cards that have always been by my side!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:55.410
And for my brother who believes in me, I will win!

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:56.750
Okay.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:01.690
If that’s the reason why you fight, then I'll also fight with all my might!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.370
My other self...

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:06.350
Leon is determined, partner.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:11.340
No matter what we say, he'll fight hard for his brother.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:16.300
Even if it damages his duelist pride.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:21.900
If that’s the case, I'll fight with all my strength.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:26.090
To have a duel we won't regret later.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.180
Right.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:29.940
Here I go!

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:32.360
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:37.600
I summon Queen's Knight in attack position!

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:42.670
Queen's Knight attacks Forest Hunter!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:53.180
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:55.870
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:06:03.020
During this Standby Phase, Iron Hans - which Iron Cage sent to the graveyard - returns to the field!

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:10.560
Since Iron Hans is back on the field, Iron Knight’s attack points return to 700.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:15.180
But Iron Hans’s effect activates!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:20.720
When Iron Hans is summoned, I can Special Summon another Iron Knight!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:24.170
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.100
Spinning Wheel Spindle!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:30.910
Isn't that from Sleeping Beauty?

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.330
I remember that card...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.720
It destroys monsters!

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:45.070
Spinning Wheel Spindle destroys one of your monsters!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.410
Queen's Knight!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:56.080
The destroyed monster is Special Summoned from the graveyard in attack position three turns from now.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:58.000
Sleep until then.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.690
This is bad!  Yugi has no monsters on his field!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:02.540
Yugi!

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:06.060
Iron Hans attacks you directly!

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:12.920
I activate my set card, Mirror Force!

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:20.490
When I'm attacked, Mirror Force destroys all your monsters in attack position!

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:26.670
Well done, Yugi!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:27.660
He did it!

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.690
Yugi!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.600
This is reality.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:36.770
No, Leon’s skills are better than this.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.780
You shouldn’t underestimate him.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.650
Leonheart, don’t betray my expectations.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.090
I’m not done!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:52.520
I activate the spell card, Water of Life from my hand!

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:02.060
It lets me Special Summon a monster from my graveyard in attack position!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:04.500
I bring back...

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.100
Iron Hans!

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:09.980
And Iron Knight accompanies Iron Hans!

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.890
I Special Summon Iron Knight in attack position!

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:17.510
It returned from the graveyard again!

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.940
How annoying!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.960
This is why Leon’s deck is scary.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:26.820
With a good balance of monsters, spells and traps, it has no weaknesses.

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:31.300
That's why he's won and made it this far.

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.260
Yeah.

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.260
I end my turn.

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:36.640
My turn!

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:37.680
I draw!

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:42.360
I activate Pot of Greed from my hand!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:47.740
It lets me draw two cards from my deck!

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:52.340
One of the cards I drew is this!

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:53.880
That card is...

00:08:53.880 --> 00:09:01.820
If I get Watapon from my deck other than by my usual draw, I can Special Summon it!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.760
I summon Watapon in attack position!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.460
Then I tribute Watapon.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:11.320
Come, Dark Magician Girl!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:24.840
I can’t believe I get to see Yugi’s Dark Magician Girl!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.580
I need to stay focused and give it my all.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.600
Go, Dark Magician Girl!

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.690
Attack Iron Knight!

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:39.120
Black Burning!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:50.070
I end my turn.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.640
Dark Magician Girl is incredible.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:10:00.250
But even though I like Dark Magician Girl, I'll destroy her!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.690
That’s right.  Good.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:05.690
We're the ones who win in the end.

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:09.900
Now Leonheart, show them your true skills.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.830
What are you planning, Sieg?

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:14.770
My turn!

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:16.430
I draw!

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:21.730
Is this coincidence?  Or is it fate?

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:25.210
I also activate Pot of Greed!

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:28.810
It lets me draw two cards!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.740
This card is...

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.810
You drew it!

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.140
You drew it!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.740
Brother!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:03.260
You’ve done well making it this far, Leonheart.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.000
I believed in you.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.750
That’s why you're my brother and a Schroeder.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.270
Yes, brother!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:14.620
Before your final battle, I have a present for you.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:18.080
For me?  Thank you, brother.

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:23.210
I’ve never seen this card before.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:25.190
It's a valuable rare card.

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:28.620
I acquired it for you, Leonheart.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:33.460
When you draw this card, use it.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.840
The goddess of victory will smile upon you.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.240
Okay!

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:44.250
It's good you drew it now.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.760
Fate is on your side, Leon.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.300
Brother!

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:55.020
Leonheart, now's the time to use that card.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.290
No one can stop our victory.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.980
Here I go, brother.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:07.550
I activate the spell card, Golden Castle of Stromberg from my hand!

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.440
What's that card?

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.800
That’s...

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:32.760
Sieg, what did you do?

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:39.810
What effect does Golden Castle of Stromberg have?

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:47.790
Huh?

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:48.780
What’s wrong?

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.230
There was some static.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.210
Nothing wrong with the subroutines.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:57.560
System check finished.  Everything normal.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.280
It was your imagination.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.260
Guess so.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.920
Golden Castle of Stromberg’s effect activates!

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:09.860
I Special Summon a Level 4 or lower monster from my deck!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.040
I summon Prinzessin in attack position!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:19.480
When Prinzessin is summoned, her effect activates!

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:24.710
I Special Summon Pumpkin Carriage from my deck or hand in defense position!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:30.520
And I can equip Prinzessin with the Equip Spell, Glass Slippers!

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.480
Be careful, Yugi!

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.770
That’s what defeated me!

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:40.500
When Pumpkin Carriage is on the field, Prinzessin can attack you directly.

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:43.340
Go, Prinzessin!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.020
Attack Yugi directly!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:57.410
When Prinzessin attacks, I can equip Glass Slippers on your monster.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:03.570
The monster equipped with Glass Slippers loses 1000 attack points.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.380
This is bad!

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.990
Don't be dumb!  Yugi won’t lose that easily!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.230
But what is Golden Castle of Stromberg?

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:16.540
You with your sneaky tricks!

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:21.160
So that's Golden Castle of Stromberg.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:24.180
I never expected that card to be here.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:25.470
Yeah.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.840
What do you mean?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.160
Grandpa, do you know something?

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.080
Is that card...

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:41.020
There are rare cards that Pegasus created for testing, never to be sold.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.440
And that’s one of them?

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.940
But what's a test card doing here?

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:53.540
Several years ago, it was given as the grand prize in a tournament.

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:57.760
Since it's a test sample, it can’t be used in a real duel.

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:01.280
But it's still a rare card that Pegasus created.

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:07.290
Collectors will do anything to get this once-in-a-lifetime card.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.720
I can’t believe I'm seeing it here.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:15.200
So you acquired it using your family's influence.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.410
You're one to talk.

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:23.420
But our Solid Vision System rejects forbidden cards.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.340
Can it be?

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:31.280
He removed the Duel Computer's limiter so that forbidden cards can be used.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.440
Isn’t that cheating?

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:39.770
That's the real reason why you hacked my main computer.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.620
What are you talking about?

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.060
All I did was acquire that card and give it to Leonheart.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.060
But don’t you think it’s funny?

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:56.010
Pegasus's card - the man who rejected my partnership - has put you in a pinch.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:59.000
How ironic.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:01.760
Is this for revenge?

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:02.450
How lame.

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:07.610
Using a test card is a cheap trick that won't work in this duel.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:13.550
You're the one who said this duel should continue, but you can quit if you want.

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.540
I never go back on my word.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.000
Continue this duel.

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:22.080
How long will your confidence last?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:26.810
No matter what you do, you can no longer escape from my trap.

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:31.800
No way...  This is a forbidden card?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.890
My brother gave me this card.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:37.340
Don’t worry about that, Leonheart!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.020
The card appeared on the field.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:44.460
So it's been accepted as an official card.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:48.800
Now show the power of that card!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.060
But...

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.220
Sieg, you...

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.180
What a punk!

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:56.650
You want to win that bad?

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:58.110
Leon...

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:02.040
Leonheart, you must do anything to win!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:06.590
It’s important to win, whatever it takes!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.720
Do it for the Schroeders.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:12.010
It'll make our mother happy too!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:12.910
But...

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.250
Sieg!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.560
Yugi?

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:26.600
You tarnished this duel and our duelist souls!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.640
You have no right to call yourself a duelist!

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:31.900
Yugi...

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.890
The soul of a duelist?

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.840
That's worthless.

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:40.940
You call it a duel, but it's only a game.

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.240
Brother...

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:44.750
Sieg.

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.570
Don’t you understand?

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:51.950
The duelists who competed in this tournament...

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:55.920
Everyone who cheered for us...

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.960
Everyone who came here...

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.920
People worldwide who love dueling...

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:10.440
Even Leon, who's battling for you!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:13.370
You’ve hurt everyone’s feelings!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:17.890
You think you're the hero?  How naive.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:23.560
Brother, did you set up this trick because you didn't trust me?

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:27.410
No, it was to guarantee victory.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:30.720
You’ve exceeded my expectations.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.660
Continue the duel, Leonheart!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:40.660
I thought I'd do anything for my brother.

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.600
But I don’t want to use this!

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:48.520
I activate my spell card, Mystical Space Typhoon!

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:55.410
Mystical Space Typhoon will destroy Golden Castle of Stromberg!

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.650
Nice, Leon!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.930
He can destroy that card!

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:02.650
He's a true duelist!

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:10.640
Why?

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.670
Too bad, Leonheart.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.290
You have to obey me.

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:22.100
Spells and traps can't destroy Golden Castle of Stromberg.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:25.110
No way!  According to the card text-

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.540
He also rewrote the text data?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.280
You...

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:38.090
Kaiba, my true revenge begins now.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:39.760
Big brother!  Look!

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.050
What?

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:48.980
You think I'd go through all that trouble just to remove the ban on forbidden cards?

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:52.300
Golden Castle of Stromberg is just a switch.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:58.240
When it was played on the field, it launched a virus program.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.380
Start the antivirus program!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.420
It’s too late.

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:10.770
Kaiba Corporation’s programs are being deleted at super speed.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:18.370
When this duel ends, you'll lose all the Duel Monsters data you created.

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:19.530
You punk!

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.060
Sieg!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:27.400
I’m sorry, but I can’t obey you, brother.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.080
Leon...

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:32.280
I love Duel Monsters.

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:37.080
So if I’m going to lose that, I'd rather...

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:39.610
It won't work, Leonheart!

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:45.550
Even if you surrender, the virus can't be stopped once it's launched.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:46.980
No way!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:51.670
But there is one way to stop it.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:57.740
By destroying Golden Castle of Stromberg during the duel!

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:03.380
But magic and traps don’t work on that card!

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:07.280
He's saying that there’s no way to stop the virus!

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:09.520
Brother...

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:12.080
Leon, let’s continue the duel.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.920
Yugi?  But...

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:17.120
This is all my fault.

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:23.720
You're still a true duelist who loves dueling.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.720
So don't give up!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.760
Fight with all your might and show him the pride of a duelist!

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:38.670
And I promise to destroy this despicable trap!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.060
Yugi...

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:42.360
Trust me.

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:16.600
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:32.320
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:38.160
Without a goal in mind

00:22:39.480 --> 00:22:46.730
We just step towards our dream

00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:52.370
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:52.560 --> 00:23:00.840
Your eye will find it

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:06.650
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:14.790
Will touch your soul

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:18.050
In a duel

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:33.390
Sieg gave Golden Castle of Stromberg to Leon.

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:38.330
That card launched a computer virus to destroy the Duel System.

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:42.730
They have to destroy the card to stop the virus.

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:47.080
But spells and traps don't work on it, and its data was rewritten.

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:50.170
Is there anything you can do, Yugi?

00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:53.470
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
KC Grand Prix Finale

00:23:53.470 --> 00:23:55.240
Duel, standby!
